{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghwrWZ9h2LUga6hkz26n","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QmwrC4ESm13QuhaMfdx3fe","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"rm -rf .tmp .serve && printf 'node_modules/\\n.tmp/\\n.serve/\\ncheck-output/\\n' > .gitignore && cat > DEV.md <<'EOF'\n# Gauntletdown: the workshop\n\nThe deliverable is `../Gauntletdown-Gauntlet-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-050244.html` (one file, works from file://).\nThis folder is the engine handoff (my-3D2dge v0.85.2, patched: ENGINE-CHANGES.md) plus the game's sources and tests.\n\n| Command | What it does |\n|---|---|\n| `npm install` | Playwright 1.63.0 for the browser suites (once) |\n| `node build.mjs` | joins `game/src/*.js` into `game/game.js` (the dev page `game/index.html` loads it) |\n| `node build.mjs --bundle` | also writes the single-file deliverable in the run folder's root (the AI Hub client first, unmodified) |\n| `node tests/run.mjs [suite ...]` | the tests: floors sim play net ui hub (all by default); prints only failures and one count line |\n| `node tools-dev/floorcheck.mjs [id]` | validates floors and prints their counts |\n| `python3 tools-dev/floors.py` | redraws floors 2-9 and the treasure rooms into `game/src/16-floors.js` |\n| `node tools-dev/botrun.mjs [ids] [--god]` | bots play floors headless and report times |\n| `node tools-dev/shots.mjs game/index.html [--size 1920x1080]` | screenshots for look review into `shots/` |\n| `node tools-dev/about.mjs` | writes the About pages and `../exit-interview.json` from one source |\n| `node tools-dev/patch-engine.mjs` | the engine changes (already applied; it refuses to apply twice) |\n\n`docs/DESIGNER.md` says how to add a floor, a monster, an item or a line. The plan the game follows is `../PLAN.md`.\nEOF\nexport TMPDIR=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-050244__x8ffc89/work/Gauntletdown-Gauntlet-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-050244/.tmp && mkdir -p $TMPDIR && node build.mjs --bundle && time (timeout 1800 node tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -6); ls -la .. | grep -v \"^d\"","description":"Clean scratch, write docs, bundle and run all tests","timeout":1820000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":969,"cache_read_input_tokens":768218,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":969},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9fe4bfc6-ee9b-4f5a-880a-60c3aeac1094","uuid":"e6f13bc0-cb86-468e-bb6c-f82c14301b99","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:13:14.759Z","request_id":"req_011CghwrWBpSY9ivo8GmFeqM","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01QmwrC4ESm13QuhaMfdx3fe":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-050244__x8ffc89/work/Gauntletdown-Gauntlet-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-050244 && rm -rf .tmp .serve && printf 'node_modules/\\n.tmp/\\n.serve/\\ncheck-output/\\n' > .gitignore && cat > DEV.md <<'EOF'\n# Gauntletdown: the workshop\n\nThe deliverable is `../Gauntletdown-Gauntlet-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-050244.html` (one file, works from file://).\nThis folder is the engine handoff (my-3D2dge v0.85.2, patched: ENGINE-CHANGES.md) plus the game's sources and tests.\n\n| Command | What it does |\n|---|---|\n| `npm install` | Playwright 1.63.0 for the browser suites (once) |\n| `node build.mjs` | joins `game/src/*.js` into `game/game.js` (the dev page `game/index.html` loads it) |\n| `node build.mjs --bundle` | also writes the single-file deliverable in the run folder's root (the AI Hub client first, unmodified) |\n| `node tests/run.mjs [suite ...]` | the tests: floors sim play net ui hub (all by default); prints only failures and one count line |\n| `node tools-dev/